# SIGAP Mobile — Cursor Rules
# Civic Mutual-Aid & Caregiver Network
# Stack: React Native (Expo) + Supabase + PostGIS

# ===========================================================
# ARSITEKTUR: FEATURE-FIRST FOLDER STRUCTURE
# ===========================================================
# src/
#   features/
#     emergency/        ← One-Tap SOS Dispatch
#     wellness/         ← Dead-Man Switch Check-in
#     microtask/        ← Neighborhood Micro-Tasks
#     auth/             ← Login, verifikasi RT/RW
#     profile/          ← ICE Card, data medis
#     admin/            ← Dashboard RT/RW
#   shared/
#     components/       ← UI atoms & molecules
#     hooks/            ← Custom hooks global
#     lib/              ← supabase client, fcm, sms-gateway
#     types/            ← Global TypeScript types
#     utils/            ← helpers (geo, format, token)
#   navigation/         ← Stack & Tab navigators
#   store/              ← Zustand global stores

# ===========================================================
# KONVENSI PENAMAAN
# ===========================================================
# Komponen          : PascalCase        → EmergencyButton.tsx
# Hooks             : camelCase + use   → useGeofenceWatch.ts
# Services/lib      : camelCase         → supabaseClient.ts
# Types/interfaces  : PascalCase + T/I  → IUser, TRole
# Constants         : SCREAMING_SNAKE   → MAX_RADIUS_METERS
# Feature folder    : kebab-case        → one-tap-emergency/

# ===========================================================
# ATURAN TYPESCRIPT
# ===========================================================
# - Selalu gunakan TypeScript strict mode (tsconfig strict: true)
# - Tidak boleh ada `any` — gunakan `unknown` lalu type-guard
# - Semua props komponen wajib didefinisikan dengan interface
# - Return type fungsi async wajib eksplisit: Promise<T>
# - Gunakan `zod` untuk runtime validation input form & API response

# ===========================================================
# ATURAN REACT NATIVE / EXPO
# ===========================================================
# - Gunakan Expo SDK terbaru (SDK 51+)
# - Navigasi: React Navigation v6 (Stack + Bottom Tabs)
# - State global: Zustand (bukan Redux, bukan Context untuk state kompleks)
# - Styling: NativeWind (Tailwind untuk RN) — tidak boleh StyleSheet inline kecuali animasi
# - Icon: @expo/vector-icons (Ionicons)
# - Hindari `useEffect` untuk data fetching — gunakan React Query (TanStack Query)
# - Semua fetch ke Supabase wajib melalui custom hook di features/*/hooks/

# ===========================================================
# ATURAN SUPABASE
# ===========================================================
# - Jangan pernah hardcode Supabase URL atau anon key di kode
# - Selalu baca dari ENV: process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
# - Row Level Security (RLS) WAJIB aktif di semua tabel
# - Gunakan Supabase Realtime hanya untuk channel emergency
# - Query geospasial (PostGIS) dilakukan via RPC function, bukan raw SQL di client
# - Supabase client singleton: src/shared/lib/supabaseClient.ts

# ===========================================================
# ATURAN FITUR EMERGENCY (KRITIS)
# ===========================================================
# - Tombol SOS tidak boleh ada loading state — UI harus responsif instan
# - Countdown 8 detik pembatalan wajib menggunakan Animated.Value (bukan setTimeout biasa)
# - WebSocket channel emergency: hanya subscribe saat user adalah Relawan & status online
# - FCM Critical Alert payload maksimal 2KB — jangan kirim data besar lewat notifikasi
# - Fallback SMS wajib ditest di environment tanpa internet sebelum production
# - Emergency token (ICE Card access) expire setelah 2 jam — validasi di server, bukan client

# ===========================================================
# ATURAN UX AKSESIBILITAS (LANSIA MODE)
# ===========================================================
# - Komponen Care-Receiver wajib punya prop `simplified?: boolean`
# - Saat simplified=true: font minimum 20sp, tombol minimum 72x72dp, kontras WCAG AA
# - Semua aksi kritis wajib ada konfirmasi audio (expo-av) selain visual
# - Jangan gunakan gesture swipe sebagai satu-satunya cara akses fitur di simplified mode
# - Tidak boleh ada bottom sheet atau modal kompleks di simplified mode

# ===========================================================
# LARANGAN KERAS (NEVER DO)
# ===========================================================
# ❌ Jangan fetch data medis (ICE Card) di luar konteks emergency aktif
# ❌ Jangan simpan koordinat GPS pengguna secara permanen di client storage
# ❌ Jangan gunakan `console.log` di production — gunakan logger util
# ❌ Jangan bypass RLS dengan service_role key di mobile client
# ❌ Jangan render komponen Admin untuk role selain civic_admin
# ❌ Jangan gunakan `expo-location` background tanpa explicit user consent flow
# ❌ Jangan commit file .env — selalu gunakan ENV_EXAMPLE.env sebagai referensi

# ===========================================================
# POLA YANG DIANJURKAN
# ===========================================================
# ✅ Gunakan custom hook per fitur: useEmergencyDispatch, useWellnessCheckin
# ✅ Semua side-effect geolokasi dibungkus dalam useGeolocation hook
# ✅ Error boundary wajib ada di level navigator setiap feature
# ✅ Optimistic UI untuk micro-task acceptance (update lokal dulu, sync kemudian)
# ✅ Semua string yang tampil ke user masuk ke i18n (id-ID default)
# ✅ Gunakan React Query untuk cache & background refetch data wellness

# ===========================================================
# TESTING
# ===========================================================
# - Unit test: Jest + React Native Testing Library
# - Minimum coverage: 80% untuk semua file di features/emergency/
# - Mock Supabase client di test: src/shared/lib/__mocks__/supabaseClient.ts
# - Snapshot test DILARANG — gunakan behavior test